d","canonical_name":"local_shop_list","capability_requirements":["erp.local.shop_list"],"description":"查询店铺列表（含所有店铺，包括新开未出单的）。毫秒级响应。返回店铺名称/平台/状态/ID，按平台分组显示。支持按平台过滤（如只看拼多多店铺）。适合：有哪些店铺、拼多多店铺列表、各平台店铺等查询。相关工具：拿到店铺名后可用 local_data(mode=summary, shop_name=...) 统计该店铺数据。","executor_revision":1,"executor_type":"runtime_read:local_shop_list","provider_schema":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"platform":{"type":"string"}},"required":[],"type":"object"},"provider_schema_hash":"81ea60c206854762e0d52bbdb7427e5efaf8d88c8e231e50463a10f646a7e4dd","reconcile_semantics":"unsupported","result_schema_revision":1,"retry_semantics":"retry_safe","safety_level":"safe","schema":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"platform":{"type":"string"}},"required":[],"type":"object"},"schema_hash":"81ea60c206854762e0d52bbdb7427e5efaf8d88c8e231e50463a10f646a7e4dd","side_effect":"none","tool_group":"erp_local"},{"allowed_channels":["web","wecom"],"allowed_scope_kinds":["channel"],"authorization_requirement":"none","cancel_semantics":"unsupported","canonical_name":"local_stock_query","capability_requirements":["erp.local.stock_query"],"description":"按商品精确编码查库存（可售/总库存/锁定/在途/各仓分布）。毫秒级响应。⚠ 需要精确编码，用户给模糊名称/简称时先调 local_product_identify 确认。相关工具：需要实时数据或本地查不到时改用 erp_product_query(stock_status)；查采购到货进度用 local_data(doc_type=purchase)。","executor_revision":1,"executor_type":"runtime_read:local_stock_query","provider_schema":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"product_code":{"type":"string"}},"required":["product_code"],"type":"object"},"provider_schema_hash":"e3419391c504cad34d149689bbdd775f19f07415ac5a1e1682f84be5ae549d99","reconcile_semantics":"unsupported","result_schema_revision":1,"retry_semantics":"retry_safe","safety_level":"safe","schema":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"product_code":{"type":"string"}},"required":["product_code"],"type":"object"},"schema_hash":"e3419391c504cad34d149689bbdd775f19f07415ac5a1e1682f84be5ae549d99","side_effect":"none","tool_group":"erp_local